          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Service shop/postgres exposes port(s) 5432 and is reachable from outside the cluster. Database, cache, and management ports (5432, 3306, 6379, 9200, 27017, 2375, 10250, 2379...) are routinely scanned; several of these protocols have no authentication enabled by default.

Evidence: k8s/app.yaml:129
exposed admin/data ports: 5432

Risk 25/25 (likelihood 5 x impact 5). Exposure: 1 hop(s) from the internet. Blast radius 7.

Remediation: Make the service ClusterIP and reach it through a bastion, VPN, or port-forward.</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
