        <b:Id>34</b:Id>
        <b:InteractionKey>f7981437-198e-5e3b-8dd4-ea64abf6ab07</b:InteractionKey>
        <b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt>
        <b:Priority>High</b:Priority>
        <b:Properties>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>Title</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Container has no CPU or memory limits</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Denial of Service</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Without resource limits, Container shop/postgres can consume all allocatable CPU and memory on its node. A memory leak or a deliberately expensive request becomes a node-wide outage: the kubelet begins evicting neighbouring pods, and a single compromised workload becomes a cluster-wide denial of service primitive.

Evidence: k8s/app.yaml:115
resources.limits.cpu is unset

Risk 12/25 (likelihood 3 x impact 4). Exposure: 3 hop(s) from the internet. Blast radius 6.

Remediation: Set requests and limits; enforce defaults with a LimitRange.</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>Priority</a:Key>
            <a:Value>High</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
        </b:Properties>
        <b:SourceGuid>f7981437-198e-5e3b-8dd4-ea64abf6ab07</b:SourceGuid>
        <b:State>NotStarted</b:State>
        <b:StateInformation>TF-K8S-013</b:StateInformation>
        <b:TargetGuid>f7981437-198e-5e3b-8dd4-ea64abf6ab07</b:TargetGuid>
        <b:Title>Container has no CPU or memory limits</b:Title>
        <b:TypeId>TF-K8S-013</b:TypeId>
        <b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded>
      </a:Value>
    </a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB>
    <a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB>
      <a:Key>TF-325D409A9E</a:Key>
      <a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase">
        <b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/>
