        <b:Priority>Medium</b:Priority>
        <b:Properties>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>Title</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Compose service has no resource limits</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Denial of Service</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>No CPU or memory limit is set, so this container can exhaust the host.

Evidence: docker-compose.yml:2
deploy.resources.limits is unset

Risk 9/25 (likelihood 3 x impact 3). Exposure: 1 hop(s) from the internet. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Set deploy.resources.limits.</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
