          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>StatefulSet shop/postgres -&gt; DataStore Salesforce CRM moves data classified as pii across a trust boundary. Each boundary crossing is a place where authentication, authorisation, encryption, and logging all need to be re-established -- assumptions that held on one side rarely hold on the other.

Evidence: threatforge-overlay.yml:8
crosses boundary:namespace:shop

Risk 9/25 (likelihood 3 x impact 3). Exposure: 2 hop(s) from the internet. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Enforce mTLS and explicit authorisation on this hop; log both sides.</a:Value>
