            <a:Value>Tampering</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>DockerImage node:latest builds FROM `node:latest`. Two builds of the same commit can produce different images, which breaks reproducibility and makes it impossible to say with confidence what is running in production.

Evidence: Dockerfile:1
FROM node:latest

Risk 4/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 4). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Pin the base image by digest.</a:Value>
