          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Without a HEALTHCHECK, a container that has hung but not exited is indistinguishable from a healthy one outside Kubernetes (where probes cover this).

Evidence: Dockerfile:1
no HEALTHCHECK instruction

Risk 3/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 3). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Add a HEALTHCHECK.</a:Value>
