            <a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Elevation of Privilege</a:Value>
          </a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Namespace shop sets no pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce label. Nothing prevents someone deploying a privileged, host-mounting pod here tomorrow, which means every workload-level fix in this report can be silently undone.

Evidence: k8s/app.yaml:2
no enforce label

Risk 3/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 3). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Label the namespace with a Pod Security Standard.</a:Value>
