            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>No encryption attribute is set on aws_s3_bucket assets. Some providers default to encrypted and some do not, and raw HCL parsing cannot resolve module defaults -- so this needs a human check rather than an assumption.

Evidence: tf/main.tf:1
no encryption attribute present

Risk 2/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 2). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Set the encryption attribute explicitly so the intent is reviewable.</a:Value>
