            <a:Value>No CPU or memory limit is set, so this container can exhaust the host.

Evidence: docker-compose.yml:11
deploy.resources.limits is unset

Risk 2/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 2). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Set deploy.resources.limits.</a:Value>
