          <a:KeyValueOfstringstring>
            <a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key>
            <a:Value>Namespace shop has no ResourceQuota, so a single runaway or malicious workload here can consume the cluster&#39;s entire allocatable capacity and starve every other tenant.

Evidence: k8s/app.yaml:2
no ResourceQuota found for this namespace

Risk 2/25 (likelihood 1 x impact 2). Exposure: unreachable from an external entity. Blast radius 0.

Remediation: Add a ResourceQuota and a LimitRange with sane defaults.</a:Value>
